{"data":{"batches":["These items are inside one part of a window in Preview that the person selected.\nItems (number | kind | label | position in the selection | part of window | details):\n1 | button | OK | bottom left\n2 | text | Paragraph number 0 of the notes | top left\n3 | text | Paragraph number 1 of the notes Paragraph number 2 of the notes Paragraph number 3 of the notes | top\n4 | text | Paragraph number 4 of the notes | left\n5 | text | Paragraph number 5 of the notes Paragraph number 6 of the notes | center\n6 | text | Paragraph number 7 of the notes | center\nExplain every item above: one entry per item, in order, using the same numbers. Say what each one is for within this selection and why someone would use it. For a text item, say in plain words what the text says and what it means for the person; do not just read it back. For a picture, say what it shows using its details, for example “This is a photo of a dog.” Do not describe the rest of the window, the app or the website. Never just repeat the label.","These items are inside one part of a window in Preview that the person selected.\nItems (number | kind | label | position in the selection | part of window | details):\n1 | text | Paragraph number 8 of the notes Paragraph number 9 of the notes | center\n2 | text | Paragraph number 10 of the notes Paragraph number 11 of the notes | bottom\n3 | text | A very long line of small print A very long line of small print A very long line of small print A very long line of small print A very long line of small print A very long line of small print A very long line of small print A very long line | bottom\nExplain every item above: one entry per item, in order, using the same numbers. Say what each one is for within this selection and why someone would use it. For a text item, say in plain words what the text says and what it means for the person; do not just read it back. For a picture, say what it shows using its details, for example “This is a photo of a dog.” Do not describe the rest of the window, the app or the website. Never just repeat the label."],"cached":false,"prompt":"The person selected one part of a window in Preview.\nItems inside the selection (number | kind | label | position in the selection | part of window | details):\n0 | visible text | Paragraph number 0 of the notes | top left\n1 | visible text | Paragraph number 1 of the notes | top\n2 | visible text | Paragraph number 2 of the notes | top left\n3 | visible text | Paragraph number 3 of the notes | top\n4 | visible text | Paragraph number 4 of the notes | left\n5 | visible text | Paragraph number 6 of the notes | left\n6 | visible text | Paragraph number 5 of the notes | center\n7 | visible text | Paragraph number 7 of the notes | center\n8 | visible text | Paragraph number 8 of the notes | left\n9 | visible text | Paragraph number 9 of the notes | bottom\n10 | visible text | Paragraph number 10 of the notes | bottom left\n11 | visible text | Paragraph number 11 of the notes | bottom\n12 | button | OK | bottom left\n13 | visible text | A very long line of small print A very long line of smal | bottom\nDescribe only what is inside the selection: what it is, what it shows or says, and what someone can do with it. Do not describe the rest of the window, the app, or the website as a whole. The visible text items are read from a picture of the selection.","request":"m1"},"ok":true}
